; The stack size is set via the linker command line (see BASELDFLAGS in
; common/Makefile.tools, -Wl,--stack ...). A STACKSIZE directive here would be
; turned by GNU dlltool into a "-stack" .drectve directive in the .exp object,
; which ld.lld (used by the CLANG64 toolchain) rejects. So leave it out.
